1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:02,821
Need emails from a company website?

2
00:00:02,821 --> 00:00:04,943
Copying them by hand takes forever.

3
00:00:05,493 --> 00:00:11,218
Email Extractor is a free Chrome extension that finds every address on a site in one click,

4
00:00:11,218 --> 00:00:14,238
and checks which ones can actually receive mail.

5
00:00:14,988 --> 00:00:17,745
Open any company website and click the icon.

6
00:00:18,645 --> 00:00:22,982
It reads the page you're on, then up to six of its contact and about pages.

7
00:00:23,432 --> 00:00:28,712
It even finds hidden ones, like protected addresses, or name at company dot com.

8
00:00:29,212 --> 00:00:31,038
Every address is labelled:

9
00:00:31,038 --> 00:00:34,551
a real person, or a team inbox like info or sales.

10
00:00:35,001 --> 00:00:37,868
Then it checks each domain for a mail server.

11
00:00:37,868 --> 00:00:40,863
Mail works, takes no mail, or domain not found.

12
00:00:41,313 --> 00:00:43,889
If some can't receive mail, it warns you,

13
00:00:43,889 --> 00:00:46,653
because bounces hurt your sender reputation.

14
00:00:47,003 --> 00:00:49,510
Want emails that land in the inbox?

15
00:00:49,510 --> 00:00:53,522
imisofts sets up your cold email infrastructure for you.

16
00:00:54,272 --> 00:00:59,132
Junk, like placeholders and no reply addresses, is hidden, and it shows you why.

17
00:00:59,732 --> 00:01:02,239
Happy with the results? Click Add all to list.

18
00:01:02,689 --> 00:01:05,270
Do the same on as many websites as you like.

19
00:01:05,270 --> 00:01:06,619
Duplicates are skipped.

20
00:01:07,119 --> 00:01:10,447
Then open My list and click Download Excel.

21
00:01:10,447 --> 00:01:14,703
Or grab a clean CSV, or send it to n8n, Make or Zapier.

22
00:01:15,503 --> 00:01:20,061
Your Excel file is ready to sort and filter, with every label and mail check.

23
00:01:20,511 --> 00:01:24,338
And if you'd rather have booked meetings than a spreadsheet,

24
00:01:24,338 --> 00:01:27,081
imisofts runs done-for-you lead generation.

25
00:01:27,081 --> 00:01:28,994
The link is right in the file.

26
00:01:29,794 --> 00:01:30,537
It's private.

27
00:01:30,537 --> 00:01:34,423
No sign-up, it only runs when you click, and we never see your list.

28
00:01:35,023 --> 00:01:37,589
Email Extractor. Free, by imisofts.

29
00:01:37,589 --> 00:01:40,009
The links are in the description.
